          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11867' id='43' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='87600'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>CRITICAL INSIGHTS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Channel Performance:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> In-Store is the strongest revenue channel at $30.06M, while profit margins remain consistent across channels at approximately 28–30%.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Discount Strategy: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Profit margin declines sharply as discounts increase, with the 40% discount level producing a negative margin. Higher discounts should be used selectively to protect profitability.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Product Performance: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Product 23 leads revenue at $2.10M, while the Top 10 products each generate approximately $1.71M–$2.10M, indicating relatively balanced performance among leading products.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Customer Value: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Customer 12 stands out as the strongest high-value customer, combining the highest revenue in the displayed group with high order frequency. Other customers show that higher order</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
